#  Pipeline Debugging Environment

A professional, minimal AI environment for debugging real-world data pipelines. This system simulates agent-based interaction with a Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) of data processing nodes. Errors appear at outputs, but root causes originate upstream. The agent must systematically explore to find where the problem starts.

**This is NOT a game.** It models real-world problems where data errors propagate downstream, requiring methodical investigation.

