## 🐳 Docker Deployment

### Build
```bash
docker build -t pipeline-debug .
```

### Run Locally
```bash
docker run -p 7860:7860 pipeline-debug
```

### Deploy to HuggingFace Spaces
1. Create Space on Hugging Face
2. Select "Docker" runtime
3. Push repo to Space
4. Space auto-builds and deploys
5. Access via `https://huggingface.co/spaces/{user}/{space}`

