## 📋 Logging Format

The inference agent prints in strict format for easy parsing:

```
[START]
[INFO] Task: Data Cleaning Pipeline (easy)
[INFO] Error: Output has 498 rows instead of 500
[INFO] Nodes: 3
[STEP 1] action=inspect_node(output) reward=0.2 total_reward=0.2
[STEP 2] action=check_schema(output) reward=0.2 total_reward=0.4
[STEP 3] action=move_to_parent(cleaner) reward=0.2 total_reward=0.6
[STEP 4] action=inspect_node(cleaner) reward=0.2 total_reward=0.8
[STEP 5] action=move_to_parent(data_source) reward=0.2 total_reward=1.0
[STEP 6] action=submit_root_cause(data_source) reward=1.0 total_reward=2.0
[INFO] Episode complete in 6 steps
[INFO] Final reward: 2.0
[INFO] Predicted root cause: data_source
[INFO] Correct root cause: data_source
[INFO] Grade: 1.00
[END]
```

