## 🔧 Customization

### Add Your Own Task

Edit `pipeline_debug_env/tasks.py`:

```python
def create_task_4_custom() -> TaskDefinition:
    nodes = {
        "source": NodeInfo(
            node_id="source",
            node_type="data_source",
            description="Your description",
            schema_info={"col1": "int", "col2": "str"},
            parents=[],
            children=["processor"]
        ),
        # ... more nodes
    }
    
    return TaskDefinition(
        task_id="task_4",
        task_name="Custom Task",
        difficulty="medium",
        nodes=nodes,
        start_node="final_output",
        correct_root_cause="source",
        error_log="Your error message",
        ground_truth_explanation="Why source is root cause"
    )

# Register in TASKS dict
TASKS["task_4"] = create_task_4_custom()
```

